# =============================================================================
# Sayfit Studio — what git tracks
#
# This repo has TWO jobs now:
#   1. Publish media assets to jsDelivr  (projects/, data/projects.json)
#   2. Version the website source code   (index.html, css/, js/, i18n/, docs/…)
#
# Job 2 was added on 2026-08-18. Before that, `*` was ignored and the site
# code lived only on disk with no history. See docs/DECISIONS.md.
#
# Everything is tracked by default; list exclusions below.
# =============================================================================

# --- Build artefacts: regenerable, large, never commit -----------------------
build/
dist/
*.exe
*.spec
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS / editor noise -------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/

# --- Local-only ---------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
node_modules/
*.log
.env
.env.*
